== demo: the SMTP sink runs in the demo process; naive loop and workers are child processes ==
SMTP sink on :52528 in this process (scripted: bob greylisted twice, carol 550 unknown, dan 451 forever); 16 members; workers are child processes

## 1. Naive campaign: a loop that sends, crashes, and is run again
   concept: with no record of what was sent, a rerun after a crash sends again to everyone before the crash point; a transient 451 is logged and skipped, so that member never gets a statement
