## 2. Create the campaign: one job per member and year
   concept: the job table is the campaign's state; its primary key (year, member_id) makes creating the campaign idempotent, and a member is never queued twice for the same year
   enqueue 2025: 16 jobs created; again: 0

## 3. Dry run on a sample
   concept: render real PDFs for a few members chosen by a stable hash, print what would be sent, send nothing and change no job: the check a person signs off before the batch starts
